the-firm-as-one-program-59 = unlines (cons "- **Q6** Quantitative research is research into the quantitative loss of an information system: modelling it purely numerically erases fundamentals. The dollar is a metric of loss." (cons "  - **Q6.1** Economics still relies on mathematically inept models; pure mathematics gives clear derivations (capitalism and communism understood from the elements that compose them)." (cons "  - **Q6.2** The success of this work is indivisible from the end of scalar financial systems, as of national borders and authorities. [S4: What Hayek argued prices must carry becomes directly available, so prices stop being the main way the economy coordinates ([S3], [P9])]" nil)))
